Upstream software and test data
-------------------------------

The public source tree contains dependencies and test-vector data
from upstream projects, including Bitcoin, RustCrypto, Zcash, Monero, RISC
Zero, and Logos projects. Their copyright and licence files remain with the
corresponding material and are not replaced by this repository's dual licence.
The dependency lockfiles pin provenance; they do not relicense dependencies.

