https://github.com/janoside/btc-rpc-explorer. The page includes its upstream
attribution and a quotation attributed there to Hal Finney.

Logos components and marks
--------------------------

The Basecamp source refers to and pins Logos Chat, Delivery, design-system,
module-builder, and runtime inputs. Those projects and the Logos marks remain
under their upstream terms. This repository does not grant a separate licence
to Logos-owned material and does not distribute compiled Logos-derived
packages as part of this release.

At review time, GitHub did not detect a repository licence for several
transitive Nix inputs (`logos-lidl`, `logos-plugin-qt`, `logos-protocol`,
`logos-qt-sdk`, `logos-test-framework`, and
`nix-bundle-logos-module-install`). They are referenced by immutable lockfile
metadata but are not vendored or redistributed in this source-only release.
Building or redistributing outputs that incorporate them requires a separate
upstream licence review.

Distribution boundary
---------------------

This repository release publishes source, documentation, test data, and
project media only. It does not publish Docker images, packages, compiled
binaries, or separately attached release assets. Git hosting services may
automatically provide archives of the repository source.
